<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Shrei</title><description>底层技术分析与实现过程，覆盖逆向工程、图形驱动栈、游戏引擎、操作系统内核与渲染管线设计</description><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/</link><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>Helldivers 2 的会话同步、地图对账与主机迁移</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/43-helldivers2-network-synchronization/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/43-helldivers2-network-synchronization/</guid><description>玩家加入、同步任务、地图生成和主机迁移共享一组会话状态。沿着 game.dll 中的同步器、RPC 与历史记录，理解这些过程怎样保持联系。</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Networking</category><category>Multiplayer</category><category>Host Migration</category><category>Determinism</category><category>State Machine</category></item><item><title>预制池、种子与烘焙：Helldivers 2 地图生成流水线</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/42-helldivers2-map-generation-pipeline/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/42-helldivers2-map-generation-pipeline/</guid><description>Steam Build 24036910 的生成代码将预制资源、随机输入、Voronoi 几何与地形输出连接起来。沿着 pass 登记、资源等待和插件调用，观察地图内容怎样逐步形成。</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Procedural Generation</category><category>Level Design</category><category>Stingray</category><category>Seed</category><category>Plugin ABI</category></item><item><title>球面分区图：区域、边与角点的数量关系</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/41-spherical-voronoi-topology-validation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/41-spherical-voronoi-topology-validation/</guid><description>512 个区域、1530 条边和 1020 个角点之间存在明确的拓扑关系。借助球面 Euler 公式与 Voronoi/Delaunay 对偶，可以快速发现不一致；计数通过之后，连通、邻接与几何合法性仍需要各自的检查。</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Procedural Generation</category><category>Spherical Voronoi</category><category>Delaunay</category><category>Computational Geometry</category><category>Stingray</category></item><item><title>Helldivers 2 的热扰动：扰动场与屏幕重采样</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/40-helldivers2-heat-haze-shader/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/40-helldivers2-heat-haze-shader/</guid><description>远处空气晃动的观感可以由屏幕颜色重采样产生。沿着 Helldivers 2 热扰动样本中的深度门控、世界射线与三维噪声，解释扰动场如何生成，以及两种应用路径怎样使用它。</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Stingray</category><category>Shader</category><category>Heat Haze</category><category>Post Processing</category><category>WebGL</category></item><item><title>性能数字中的整帧、提交与分批开销</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/38-performance-number-scope/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/38-performance-number-scope/</guid><description>Render Path 约 1ms、旗舰机目标 60 帧和分批开销，描述的是不同事情。把数字放回对应工作与时间线，才能理解一次渲染架构调整带来的变化。</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Performance</category><category>Benchmark</category><category>Rendering</category><category>ECS</category><category>Evidence</category></item><item><title>从 fence 字段到区域标记：一次 ECS 同步分析误判</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/37-field-name-is-not-semantics/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/37-field-name-is-not-semantics/</guid><description>名叫 fence 的字段、SyncJobFence 方法与 UI fence API 看起来彼此相关，一个步长相同的循环又强化了这种印象。函数归属与读写位置却把它们带向了不同的解释。</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>ECS</category><category>Synchronization</category><category>Evidence</category><category>Unity</category></item><item><title>从边框关系构造主体场</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/36-subject-field-without-neural-network/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/36-subject-field-without-neural-network/</guid><description>全局颜色对比可能把占满画面的主体判断成背景。从边框颜色建立种子，再沿相似颜色传播，可以补充空间关系，也让主体场的几种失败原因变得容易理解。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Image Processing</category><category>Saliency</category><category>LAB</category><category>ASCII Art</category><category>Computer Vision</category><category>Mathematical Morphology</category></item><item><title>卡片箔面材质：让颜色随表面与视角变化</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/35-card-foil-data-driven-material-profile/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/35-card-foil-data-driven-material-profile/</guid><description>箔面质感依赖空间区域、表面方向与不同尺度的闪光共同作用。把这些关系拆清楚，再用数据描述不同卡片的差异，能让材质调整更可控，也让性能测量有明确对象。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>WebGL2</category><category>GLSL</category><category>Shader</category><category>Material</category><category>Data Driven</category><category>GPU Profiling</category></item><item><title>Agent 代码导航：让查找服务于理解</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/34-persistent-code-index-for-agents/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/34-persistent-code-index-for-agents/</guid><description>大型项目里的困难常常从找到相关代码开始。代码索引的价值，是让 Agent 少做重复查找，更快回到源文件；阅读和判断仍然围绕真实代码展开。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Agent</category><category>Code Index</category><category>Architecture</category></item><item><title>文本化协作：让人和 Agent 都能接着编辑</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/33-agent-safe-graph-editing-protocol/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/33-agent-safe-graph-editing-protocol/</guid><description>人和 Agent 共同编辑时，真正有价值的是双方的修改都能被理解和接续。文本与差异让协作围绕作品展开，也让分歧有具体的讨论对象。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Agent</category><category>Text Workspace</category><category>Collaboration</category></item><item><title>双后端渲染中的中间表示与有界精修</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/32-dual-backend-intermediate-representation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/32-dual-backend-intermediate-representation/</guid><description>实时渲染与可微优化若各自产生图片，很难解释质量差异。让两者共享一份可保存的笔触计划，再由同一个最终渲染器评估结果，可以把规划、精修与材质问题分开讨论。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>D3D12</category><category>CUDA</category><category>PyTorch</category><category>Intermediate Representation</category><category>Differentiable Rendering</category><category>Shader</category></item><item><title>终末地角色湿润 Shader：逐 Draw ABI 与三类材质坐标</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/31-endfield-character-wetness-shader/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/31-endfield-character-wetness-shader/</guid><description>水体、雨水与玩法状态进入逐 Draw 数据，再由衣服、面部和头发采用不同坐标与细节生成方式。控制器、参数表和像素程序共同解释了角色湿润的变化。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形逆向</category><category>Unity</category><category>Shader</category><category>DXBC</category><category>Wetness</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Rendering</category></item><item><title>渲染捕获中的资源版本与首个分歧</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/30-render-fact-closure-first-divergence/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/30-render-fact-closure-first-divergence/</guid><description>一份调用列表仍不足以解释最终画面。把资源内容与具体写入关联，再从目标输出反向追溯依赖，才能判断捕获是否完整，并把回放差异定位到第一个可观察的位置。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形逆向</category><category>Graphics</category><category>D3D11</category><category>D3D12</category><category>Frame Capture</category><category>Replay</category><category>Render Graph</category></item><item><title>代码虚拟化分析中的语义恢复与兼容复现</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/29-code-virtualization-climb-or-bypass/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/29-code-virtualization-climb-or-bypass/</guid><description>资源加载走进一段难以直接反编译的保护代码后，分析目标开始影响路线选择。终末地归档恢复的经历，说明了理解内部执行与复现外部结果之间的区别。</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Virtualization</category><category>Anti-Analysis</category><category>Methodology</category><category>Unity</category></item><item><title>Archetype ECS 的渲染提交与流式列补写</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/28-archetype-ecs-render-streaming-boundary/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/28-archetype-ecs-render-streaming-boundary/</guid><description>ECS 列数据经过剔除与列表句柄进入渲染，又在资源加载完成时得到补写。沿着相机参数、组件寻址与 Binder，观察这两个方向如何在渲染 World 中会合。</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Unity</category><category>ECS</category><category>Archetype</category><category>Rendering</category><category>Serialization</category></item><item><title>终末地资源的两层保护：从 VFS 校验到归档恢复</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/27-endfield-vfs-two-layer-analysis/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/27-endfield-vfs-two-layer-analysis/</guid><description>从&quot;MD5 校验通过但 UnityPy 枚举出 0 个对象&quot;这一矛盾出发，区分 VFS 文件层与 AssetBundle 归档层。记录 key、counter、处理顺序和压缩方言的排除矩阵，以及算法体落入 .tvm0 后如何用强判据、独立约束和全量样本形成兼容实现。</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>AssetBundle</category><category>ChaCha20</category><category>LZ4</category><category>Methodology</category></item><item><title>有限调色板的色域预算与区域相位色点</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/26-pixel-art-palette-budget/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/26-pixel-art-palette-budget/</guid><description>调色板只有 16 个名额时，按像素误差聚类容易忽略面积小但具有结构价值的颜色。用色相、冷暖和明度分配部分预算，再让色点跟随区域变化，可以明确表达这些取舍。</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Pixel Art</category><category>Palette</category><category>Dithering</category><category>Color Science</category></item><item><title>像素画重绘的区域优先架构：碎斑的成因与区域连续性</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/25-pixel-art-region-first-architecture/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/25-pixel-art-region-first-architecture/</guid><description>高频图像经过独立采样与量化后，容易在低分辨率下产生碎斑。区域优先的处理保留相邻格子的共同来源，并在合并前保护小特征；它改善了连续性，也需要面对栅格化和颜色混合的取舍。</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Pixel Art</category><category>Image Processing</category><category>Superpixel</category><category>LAB</category></item><item><title>刷怪导演中的随机、容量与生命周期</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/39-spawn-director-design/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/39-spawn-director-design/</guid><description>刷怪系统的难点在于让选择、落点、提交和回收保持一致。独立随机序列帮助复现，占用修正控制分布，容量预留与生命周期记录则避免失败和并发让计数漂移。</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Spawn System</category><category>AI Director</category><category>Determinism</category><category>State Machine</category><category>Game Design</category></item><item><title>运行态贴图提取：采样状态与角色外观</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/24-runtime-texture-extraction/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/24-runtime-texture-extraction/</guid><description>贴图已经导出，角色仍可能上下颠倒、颜色错误，甚至混入另一趟 draw 的资源。从一次运行态提取中的问题出发，区分快照一致性、格式解释、坐标约定与着色器合成各自负责的内容。</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>Graphics</category><category>D3D11</category><category>Texture</category><category>Shader</category></item><item><title>Archetype ECS 中的定长描述符与查询切分</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/22-archetype-ecs-design/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/22-archetype-ecs-design/</guid><description>在大型 Unity 项目里，除了官方 DOTS，还有一种自成体系的 Archetype ECS。128 位定长掩码、值类型 EntityManager、编译期注册、逻辑与渲染双 World。本文按存储、迁移、查询切分和双 World 同步把这套取舍拆开。</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Unity</category><category>ECS</category><category>Archetype</category><category>DOTS</category><category>Architecture</category></item><item><title>运行态模型提取：从读到数据到保留语义</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/23-runtime-model-extraction/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/23-runtime-model-extraction/</guid><description>模型文件能打开，仍可能带着错误的骨骼空间、伪 UV 和被截断的顶点属性。以一次 Unity 运行态提取为例，说明对象身份、CPU/GPU 数据来源与导出格式怎样共同决定结果是否可信。</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>Mesh</category><category>Skeleton</category><category>GPU Readback</category></item><item><title>SiNiSistar 2 资源解密：256 位块宽的 Rijndael</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/21-sinisistar2-ab-decryption/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/21-sinisistar2-ab-decryption/</guid><description>一批无法由通用工具读取的 AssetBundle，沿加载代码追到了 RijndaelManaged。256 位块宽、按文字编码的参数，以及游戏中 Key/IV 字段的反向使用，解释了资源解密中的几个细节。</description><pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>AssetBundle</category><category>Rijndael</category><category>Frida</category></item><item><title>高度场驱动的 WebGL 折射与接缝过渡</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/20-starlake-wallpaper-refraction-seam/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/20-starlake-wallpaper-refraction-seam/</guid><description>壁纸在水面波动时产生折射扭曲，壁纸和正文之间有一段平滑过渡带而不是硬切。这两个效果都在一个 fragment shader 里完成，靠高度场纹理驱动位移，靠 CSS 变量控制色调。</description><pubDate>Sat, 20 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>WebGL</category><category>GLSL</category><category>Shader</category><category>Canvas</category></item><item><title>二维波动方程的数值模拟：Canvas 上的水面高度场</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/19-starlake-wavefield-fluid-sim/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/19-starlake-wavefield-fluid-sim/</guid><description>博客背景的水面波动是跑在 Canvas 上的二维波动方程数值解。从离散化公式、双缓冲、高斯扰动注入、视口剔除到风场驱动，拆开一个水面模拟系统的每一层。</description><pubDate>Fri, 19 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Canvas</category><category>WebGL</category><category>Fluid Simulation</category><category>Wave Equation</category></item><item><title>UE 反射中的名字、对象、世界与函数调用</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/18-ue-four-piece-reflection-chain/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/18-ue-four-piece-reflection-chain/</guid><description>GNames、GObjects、GWorld 与 ProcessEvent 分别帮助解释名称、对象归属、场景上下文和反射调用。理解它们之间的关系，比把四个地址当作固定配方更有价值。</description><pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>UE 逆向</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Reflection</category><category>GNames</category><category>GObjects</category><category>GWorld</category><category>ProcessEvent</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP Internal Call：从名称解析到引擎函数</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/16-il2cpp-internal-call-resolution/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/16-il2cpp-internal-call-resolution/</guid><description>部分 UnityEngine API 通过 internal call 进入 UnityPlayer。generated wrapper 缓存的是解析后的函数入口，实际的对象查找与业务行为仍在每次调用时发生。</description><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>GameAssembly</category><category>UnityPlayer</category></item><item><title>UE 三面映射材质：从空间投影到法线混合</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/15-ue-triplanar-material/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/15-ue-triplanar-material/</guid><description>三面映射把纹理尺度从网格 UV 转移到空间坐标，却也带来了坐标选择、方向权重和法线基底的问题。沿着这条数据流，可以理解它适合什么材质，以及接缝和光照错误从何而来。</description><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形渲染</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>Material</category><category>Triplanar</category><category>Shader</category><category>Rendering</category></item><item><title>UE5 Chaos 碰撞线框：形状、身份与坐标空间</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/09-ue5-chaos-collision-wireframe/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/09-ue5-chaos-collision-wireframe/</guid><description>从组件、物理体与形状的对应关系出发，梳理 Chaos 碰撞数据的读取边界、坐标变换和凸包拓扑，区分可视化线框与可用于查询的表面。</description><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>UE 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>UE5</category><category>Collision</category><category>Chaos</category></item><item><title>Windows 异常机制：执行现场的分发与恢复</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/12-windows-exception-context-dispatch/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/12-windows-exception-context-dispatch/</guid><description>从一次断点命中出发，理解异常记录与线程上下文如何经过调试器、VEH 和 SEH，以及处理器的选择如何影响线程恢复。</description><pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Windows 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Windows</category><category>Exception Handling</category><category>VEH</category><category>SEH</category><category>Debugging</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP Registration 与字段偏移的运行时恢复</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/11-il2cpp-registration-runtime-recovery/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/11-il2cpp-registration-runtime-recovery/</guid><description>将 metadata 的定义索引接到 Registration 的生成数据，解释字段偏移和方法地址的恢复过程，以及静态字段、值类型、泛型和版本差异带来的边界。</description><pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>Registration</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP Metadata 的跨进程定位与类型系统恢复</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/10-il2cpp-metadata-recovery/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/10-il2cpp-metadata-recovery/</guid><description>利用 metadata 的表结构与交叉引用缩小候选范围，按目标页组织跨进程读取，再从完整快照恢复类型定义；同时说明版本、评分与运行时布局的边界。</description><pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>Metadata</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>Unity IL2CPP 启动原理：从 UnityPlayer 到 GameAssembly 的初始化序列</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/01-il2cpp-init-deep-dive/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/01-il2cpp-init-deep-dive/</guid><description>双击运行 Unity 游戏时，引擎内部经历了一系列初始化序列，才能把 C# 代码真正运转起来。本文基于 Unity 2022.3.62 IL2CPP 产物的逆向分析，从 UnityPlayer 动态加载 GameAssembly 讲到 MetadataCache、Registration 表、类型索引、方法查询和内存布局。</description><pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP 注册表中的泛型、类型与代码计数</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/02-il2cpp-registration-counts/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/02-il2cpp-registration-counts/</guid><description>泛型规格、类型登记和代码入口的数量描述了 IL2CPP 构建产物的一部分结构，但不能直接换算成源码规模或运行成本。理解共享与索引关系，才能正确比较这些计数。</description><pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>Windows 控制流追踪：用硬件断点与 VEH 实现基本块级 trace</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/08-windows-dr-veh-control-flow-tracing/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/08-windows-dr-veh-control-flow-tracing/</guid><description>DR0-DR3 提供少量执行观察点，VEH 在命中后记录现场并轮换观察位置。这种基本块追踪减少了逐指令异常，也让线程状态与间接跳转成为设计重点。</description><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Windows 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Windows</category><category>Debug Register</category><category>VEH</category><category>Control Flow</category></item><item><title>MCP 与长期工作：会话结束，内容仍然留下</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/13-local-bridge-named-pipe-routing/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/13-local-bridge-named-pipe-routing/</guid><description>Agent 的一次会话通常比一项工作短。把工作放在项目、文件和编辑器中，让连接围绕它们变化，才能让人真正接着已有内容往下做。</description><pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Agent</category><category>Text Workspace</category><category>Collaboration</category></item><item><title>文本化编辑：让一次修改留下可读的差异</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/07-mcp-context-optimization/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/07-mcp-context-optimization/</guid><description>文本化最吸引我的地方，是修改能留下可读的差异。文件让人和 Agent 共享编辑对象，差异则让意图、讨论与历史围绕同一处变化展开。</description><pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Agent</category><category>Text Workspace</category><category>Editing</category></item><item><title>MCP 写入反馈：让修改的结果可以理解</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/06-declarative-write-and-diff-token/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/06-declarative-write-and-diff-token/</guid><description>工具返回成功之后，人和 Agent 仍可能不知道软件里实际发生了什么。好的写入反馈让编辑意图与结果接得起来，也让失败之后的工作有处可接。</description><pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Agent</category><category>Editing</category><category>Feedback</category></item><item><title>MCP 设计理念：让 Agent 拥有合适的工作环境</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/05-mcp-tool-design/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/05-mcp-tool-design/</guid><description>把软件功能接给 Agent 之后，编辑体验仍然可能很差。我现在更看重文本化的工作环境：修改有落点，过程能审阅，工作能在对话之外继续。</description><pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Agent</category><category>Architecture</category><category>Text Workspace</category></item><item><title>Vulkan 游戏中 DXGI 与 D3D12 对象的来源分析</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/04-vulkan-dxgi-d3d12-swapchain/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/04-vulkan-dxgi-d3d12-swapchain/</guid><description>NVIDIA 驱动样本中，Vulkan 交换链图像与 DXGI 呈现队列出现在同一条分析链上。沿着图像创建、共享围栏和呈现线程，理解这些对象为何能共存于 Vulkan 进程。</description><pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Graphics</category><category>Vulkan</category><category>DXGI</category><category>D3D12</category><category>NVIDIA</category></item><item><title>从 Vulkan ICD 到 WDDM Miniport：NVIDIA Windows 图形驱动行为链静态分析</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/03-nvidia-graphics-driver-stack/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/03-nvidia-graphics-driver-stack/</guid><description>从注册表、Vulkan manifest 与驱动模块的调用位置出发，梳理 NVIDIA Windows 图形栈中 ICD、D3D 用户态驱动与内核 miniport 的分工。</description><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Graphics</category><category>Vulkan</category><category>DXGI</category><category>D3D12</category><category>NVIDIA</category></item></channel></rss>